{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DcgMz11EyK37LcUrJuhDYX","type":"tool_result","content":"30\t\n31\t## Drafting note for §3\n32\t\n33\tThese two sentences together *are* the cardinality mechanic, stated as identity rather than as a\n34\twarning: a metric plus its label set defines the series, so changing a label value defines a\n35\tdifferent one. §3 can teach cardinality as a consequence of the data model rather than as a rule to\n36\tmemorise — which is the difference between a 🔭 Closer Look that earns its place and one that reads\n37\tas trivia. The operational warning is in\n38\t`prometheus-naming-labels-cardinality-2026-08-31.md`.\n39\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"82977d3f-dade-46ff-8162-aa1f979ee266","uuid":"424a4bf3-3c65-4aef-a88b-3a448baa9a75","timestamp":"2026-08-31T22:08:05.975Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\dev\\lodestar\\Book-KCNA\\sources\\prometheus-data-model-2026-08-31.md","content":"\n## Drafting note for §3\n\nThese two sentences together *are* the cardinality mechanic, stated as identity rather than as a\nwarning: a metric plus its label set defines the series, so changing a label value defines a\ndifferent one. §3 can teach cardinality as a consequence of the data model rather than as a rule to\nmemorise — which is the difference between a 🔭 Closer Look that earns its place and one that reads\nas trivia. The operational warning is in\n`prometheus-naming-labels-cardinality-2026-08-31.md`.\n","numLines":10,"startLine":30,"totalLines":39}}}
