{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0155XYeQ2f9TZtwY2oVSxatX","type":"tool_result","content":"46\t2. **Trap #99 applies.** This snapshot names a current maturity level. Per B3 and the outline's\n47\t   §7 Practice constraint, **no item may be graded on a project's current CNCF maturity level.** The\n48\t   status may support prose. It may not support a question.\n49\t\n50\t## Drafting note for §6\n51\t\n52\tThe already-cached `fluent-bit-overview-2026-08-23.md` states the relationship from the child's\n53\tside — Fluent Bit created 2014, a sub-project of Fluentd, both commonly deployed as node-level\n54\tDaemonSets. Between the two snapshots §6 has the full picture without needing a third fetch. The\n55\tfootprint numbers are the sourced reason a *lightweight* agent exists at all, which is the honest\n56\tanswer to \"why are there two of these\" — but they are detail, not surface. One clause at most.\n57\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"82977d3f-dade-46ff-8162-aa1f979ee266","uuid":"dafccc60-0ee8-4776-8b68-11339cfe15a7","timestamp":"2026-08-31T22:08:08.336Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\dev\\lodestar\\Book-KCNA\\sources\\fluentd-architecture-2026-08-31.md","content":"2. **Trap #99 applies.** This snapshot names a current maturity level. Per B3 and the outline's\n   §7 Practice constraint, **no item may be graded on a project's current CNCF maturity level.** The\n   status may support prose. It may not support a question.\n\n## Drafting note for §6\n\nThe already-cached `fluent-bit-overview-2026-08-23.md` states the relationship from the child's\nside — Fluent Bit created 2014, a sub-project of Fluentd, both commonly deployed as node-level\nDaemonSets. Between the two snapshots §6 has the full picture without needing a third fetch. The\nfootprint numbers are the sourced reason a *lightweight* agent exists at all, which is the honest\nanswer to \"why are there two of these\" — but they are detail, not surface. One clause at most.\n","numLines":12,"startLine":46,"totalLines":57}}}
