{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HKTjFSEH3pPgzMMo7AsjtG","type":"tool_result","content":"50\tThe words **receiver**, **processor** and **exporter** as named pipeline stages were not captured\n51\tverbatim from this page. §2 may say the Collector \"receives, processes and exports\" telemetry —\n52\tthat phrasing is verbatim above — but must **not** present receivers/processors/exporters as a\n53\tnamed three-part taxonomy without a re-fetch. See manifest gap G-18c.\n54\t\n55\t## Drafting note for §2 and §8\n56\t\n57\tThe Unification objective is the sourced version of §8's second synthesis beat: one codebase, three\n58\tsignal types, deployable in two shapes. And \"sending to one or more open source or commercial\n59\tbackends\" is the sourced separability claim — instrumentation and backend are different things,\n60\twhich is the shape §8 says recurred all chapter (OTel exports / Jaeger receives; Prometheus stores /\n61\tGrafana reads; kubelet writes / agent ships).\n62\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"82977d3f-dade-46ff-8162-aa1f979ee266","uuid":"5dafa8e2-462c-4f16-971b-e5a2aa57095f","timestamp":"2026-08-31T22:08:16.053Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\dev\\lodestar\\Book-KCNA\\sources\\opentelemetry-collector-2026-08-31.md","content":"The words **receiver**, **processor** and **exporter** as named pipeline stages were not captured\nverbatim from this page. §2 may say the Collector \"receives, processes and exports\" telemetry —\nthat phrasing is verbatim above — but must **not** present receivers/processors/exporters as a\nnamed three-part taxonomy without a re-fetch. See manifest gap G-18c.\n\n## Drafting note for §2 and §8\n\nThe Unification objective is the sourced version of §8's second synthesis beat: one codebase, three\nsignal types, deployable in two shapes. And \"sending to one or more open source or commercial\nbackends\" is the sourced separability claim — instrumentation and backend are different things,\nwhich is the shape §8 says recurred all chapter (OTel exports / Jaeger receives; Prometheus stores /\nGrafana reads; kubelet writes / agent ships).\n","numLines":13,"startLine":50,"totalLines":62}}}
