{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013gJZw7YSyickFQc1DXkbrx","type":"tool_result","content":"486:=== APPEND C:\\dev\\lodestar\\certcomp\\..\\Book-KCNA/knowledge-base/objective-coverage.md ===\n487-\n488-## Chapter 17 (2026-08-31)\n489-\n490-| Objective | First covered in | Depth | Last reviewed |\n491-|---|---|---|---|\n492-| D4.2 — Cloud Native Ecosystem and Principles | Chapter 17 | deep — whole competency | 2026-08-31 |\n493-| D4.3 — Cloud Native Community and Collaboration | Chapter 17 | deep — whole competency | 2026-08-31 |\n494-\n495-### The D4 competency list is now sourced — correction to the draft's own gap note\n496-\n497-`cncf-kcna-curriculum-pdf-2026-08-23` line 16 publishes the domain and its competencies:\n498-\n499-    12% – Cloud Native Architecture: Observability; Cloud Native Ecosystem\n500-          and Principles; Cloud Native Community and Collaboration\n501-\n502-The draft's chapter-wide AUTHOR-REVIEW asserts no cached snapshot supports the\n503-count or the names. It does, and it is the snapshot all sixteen shipped chapters\n504-already cite. Two corrections follow: the third competency is **Observability**,\n505-not \"Cloud Native Observability\"; and the metadata line should follow shipped\n506-Ch 16's form at ch16:227.\n507-\n508-### The curriculum's own ordering corroborates the chapter split\n--\n546:=== APPEND C:\\dev\\lodestar\\certcomp\\..\\Book-KCNA/knowledge-base/retrieval-log.md ===\n547-\n548-## Chapter 17 (2026-08-31)\n549-\n550-| Tested topic | Original chapter | Retested in |\n551-|---|---|---|\n552-| image immutability vs immutable infrastructure | ch 2 §2 | ch 17 Bearings 1 Q6 |\n553-| the four pluggable interfaces | ch 2 §4 · 6 §8 · 9 §1 · 11 §5 | ch 17 Bearings 2 Q1 |\n554-| NetworkPolicy cannot encrypt | ch 10 §6–§7 | ch 17 Bearings 2 Q3, Practice Q12 |\n555-| CRD vs API aggregation | ch 6 §8 | ch 17 Practice Q9 |\n556-| Helm crds/ ordering | ch 14 §6 | ch 17 Practice Q10 |\n557-| metrics-server / kubectl top | ch 13 §7 | ch 17 Practice Q16 |\n558-| Pending / unschedulable / preemption | ch 7 §2 | ch 17 Practice Q17 |\n559-| release cadence + support window | ch 8 §6 | ch 17 Bearings 3 Q4, Practice Q19 |\n560-| the absent-component pattern | ch 3 (phrase) · ch 10 §3 (named) | ch 13 x3, ch 17 §7 |\n561-| version-skew decay anchor | ch 8 §6 | ch 17 §8 |\n562-\n563-### Compliance against B3\n564-\n565-B3 sets Chapter 17 at the 25% ceiling — one of five chapters there, \"because\n566-retrieval IS the chapter's method, not a tax on it.\"\n567-\n568-Measured: 4 of 16 checkpoint questions (25%) and 6 of 21 practice questions"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"82977d3f-dade-46ff-8162-aa1f979ee266","uuid":"6f9c9a80-37e2-4bd0-95d4-bd563736d93e","timestamp":"2026-08-31T22:09:27.032Z","tool_use_result":{"mode":"content","numFiles":0,"filenames":[],"content":"486:=== APPEND C:\\dev\\lodestar\\certcomp\\..\\Book-KCNA/knowledge-base/objective-coverage.md ===\n487-\n488-## Chapter 17 (2026-08-31)\n489-\n490-| Objective | First covered in | Depth | Last reviewed |\n491-|---|---|---|---|\n492-| D4.2 — Cloud Native Ecosystem and Principles | Chapter 17 | deep — whole competency | 2026-08-31 |\n493-| D4.3 — Cloud Native Community and Collaboration | Chapter 17 | deep — whole competency | 2026-08-31 |\n494-\n495-### The D4 competency list is now sourced — correction to the draft's own gap note\n496-\n497-`cncf-kcna-curriculum-pdf-2026-08-23` line 16 publishes the domain and its competencies:\n498-\n499-    12% – Cloud Native Architecture: Observability; Cloud Native Ecosystem\n500-          and Principles; Cloud Native Community and Collaboration\n501-\n502-The draft's chapter-wide AUTHOR-REVIEW asserts no cached snapshot supports the\n503-count or the names. It does, and it is the snapshot all sixteen shipped chapters\n504-already cite. Two corrections follow: the third competency is **Observability**,\n505-not \"Cloud Native Observability\"; and the metada